    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d420">

                <pb facs="0651" n="639" sameAs="frus:frus1945v06/pg639"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 P.W./8–1145: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-08-11">August 11,
                        1945</date>.<lb/>[Received August 11—11:10 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2264. White House Nbr 325 from the Secretary of State requesting delivery of a
                    message from the President to the Prime Minister<anchor n="62" xml:id="d420-f1"
                    /> was telephoned to the Prime Minister, who is at Chequers, within five minutes
                    of its receipt at the Embassy.</p>
                <p>The Prime Minister asked me to forward the following message to the President:
                        <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“In reply to your message in regard to your proposals for the acceptance
                            of the Japanese surrender I am in accord with the general <pb
                                facs="0652" n="640" xml:id="pg640"/> procedure you propose and I
                            designate Admiral Sir Bruce Austin Fraser<anchor n="62a"
                                xml:id="d420-f2"/> our representative.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Winant</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d420-f1" n="62" xml:id="d420-f1-content">
                <p>See first paragraph of Extract of Minutes, <ref target="#pg634">p. 634</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d420-f2" n="62a" xml:id="d420-f2-content">
                <p>Commander in Chief of the British Pacific Fleet.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
